"Custom :ref:`extraction filters <tarfile-extraction-filter>` should "
"raise :exc:`FilterError` for *fatal* errors and :exc:`ExtractError` for *non-"
"fatal* ones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tarfile.rst:634
