#: ../../library/tarfile.rst:684
msgid "Recursion adds entries in sorted order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tarfile.rst:690
msgid ""
"Add the :class:`TarInfo` object *tarinfo* to the archive. If *tarinfo* "
"represents a non zero-size regular file, the *fileobj* argument should be "
"a :term:`binary file`, and ``tarinfo.size`` bytes are read from it and added "
"to the archive.  You can create :class:`TarInfo` objects directly, or by "
